{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10005_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:55815a54d0dd77bde91ed7b5e2565c8a97780c05d2ff4d962121966b7cfa8536",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cfa4a142419b64660117117db40f0f68cfe8b02b143dc428e4c5afd543a04ba",
      "text": "连结·解开",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ad16b649894441efcaac51cf7c427f866e827d9b2f66bee7082462395251ce1",
      "text": "彩被选为情人节期间限定巧克力的宣传偶像。\n活动上的谈话主题是“想向成员传达的感谢”。\n为了收集能让客人们开心的谈资，\n他们决定前往翔真常去的一家店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cfa4a142419b64660117117db40f0f68cfe8b02b143dc428e4c5afd543a04ba",
      "text": "连结·解开",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d256a37270970dd9900f8a4434bab1a998bf1ca70fb4d68dba2e92f1d8db729b",
      "text": "清澄宅邸·九郎的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9264eecd8434853bffde474bc06a258403a6a0b03c8c782b37cbfa8036ca5d46",
      "text": "敬启者，值此立春时节……不知近来\n贵体安康否……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b57267a8b1d4f7605a6b0e695750c476c09b3ebcf4a519d42949c6a389bc2924",
      "text": "（情人节期间限定巧克力，\n“结-yui-”……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c60b1da65f3ffe7fb10f135b5f86c6418b2971f6d21dd7df379e9c2f393d66c",
      "text": "（我们彩竟然能被选为其宣传偶像。\n真是令人感激不尽的邀约）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e08aaaa01ed35e733d71f6d1b631591b31555de89d1fe5f0a8b04e6c2f367ab",
      "text": "（宣传活动中的谈话主题，\n既然是“想向成员传达的感谢”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbf9de3b5ea1857a8753b3a4586f5c156267628ffe257a77c14d38e42c8c3462",
      "text": "（那就向一直照顾我的两位，\n写下一封饱含感谢之情的书信吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf539a5c722ede32dabce4ea57aa7aaf1bfc0a38bd728fcbcf05c75cabfab95",
      "text": "……草草数笔，谨祝身体健康。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:288ff76f21563809aa2f3790d9d5373d09bb547f9bfb3f0a27467f3478b7161f",
      "text": "好了。信也写完了，\n重新通读一遍“结-yui-”的资料吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b1a2ccbd6aefb9ac402b85440f1883d3a2b43492ee7a4b5d30414152922f693",
      "text": "九郎，关于下次茶会的事，我有话同你讲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a4767e1fae0e1b23dda948fe902c3a9cecf70435f5473b0738faa633bcbf6b5",
      "text": "祖父大人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24ed15c87cae8ec6d77fa8650e9bd8079b012915a1a60b2f86f0d75ef054d83e",
      "text": "那是……你还在搞什么\n当偶像这种轻浮的事情吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f778a29dacc20f903bea77a7c9623c3ae832382fbce060a7694e43ed95276e7d",
      "text": "适可而止吧。\n你作为清澄流当家的自觉还远远不够！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:420505f1d02ef16dae32f5c34abe8b07db51b2367f93bc4c908fe9756d3d51fe",
      "text": "呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b2fe02fa6d48f36f48aab9598289b9440cc0e8eca644ab071b585a132d6a96",
      "text": "（祖父大人是认为，无论如何都应当\n将传统放在首位吧。但是，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c8b92d9ab01999f94486c7ff85a793f39c30c5b8b5021671eef3826add8deed",
      "text": "（我一定会将茶道发扬光大的。用新获得的\n“偶像”这一先进手段！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:857be29ed9abde82413bc487d42115b82f156a07abca592757167b07a941e4fc",
      "text": "喔！这就是要在活动的\n谈话环节上用的信喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:104747fb9b02f79004ddfee50cc1118b6d5ea1d800357ed52eb07822ab6b5b0f",
      "text": "是的。为了保险起见，能请您先过目一遍吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a21f2d1173598f57047ead9d26f4cda80a7f66c4a631b3603f674984ac886ae1",
      "text": "那么，咱这就来看看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a4413430ef61f3b782037f52d0fa1e3a741ac671dd93751fa3124af1929037e",
      "text": "生硬！太生硬了啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:665d43d9b77b0db69df8f42dee59fe9c2a8cbb9b6682b5aa4628018a16f5af5d",
      "text": "怎……\n不是祖父，而是我吗……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ed0e706823249cdf11c98b07295ffa810010f965a210b19111ae321dffe409",
      "text": "哎呀，虽说比起家里人，\n你的思维方式已经算很超前了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29a567699b824cc5b67031f64f67abf5330e030b130e3bf07e4b9ddefef4f513",
      "text": "但像奴家和小少爷一样，\n再——放轻松一点怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96e3902f1c10ef9caa533d5298526064a0554ee59fa89d2bb1eb3b1399d1c9f3",
      "text": "两位也太过于自由散漫了！\n在前几天的训练课上也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b1ac6f7650b05bf31a9bb149782dce5af71f1f99e25f4dec7f991242f7eccf8",
      "text": "喵喵～九郎君的说教又\n开始了喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a0c9a27f230c43260944621570c9dfc50e0443fab8747dbb728c5605e71da67",
      "text": "猫柳先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e710f097f3773e804200464a01d73a716e69f18dd882dad9a00eb99187d1ca",
      "text": "九郎君需要好好放松一下喵！\n制作人君，你也这么觉得喵吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_b:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acae316ad2aa74de7b59e31e23de452d3a82d01b95fc192c25729ed7be98dca2",
      "text": "这我可不能当作没听见。\n●●●●プロデューサー，您是哪一边的同伴？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89115611f7b078845788ef447ac7036561c8487cd9e65f7934a41a169e762a2a",
      "text": "九郎先生、桐生先生。\n我可没办法偏袒任何一方哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8d5111b668a20fa1ea7cd77ed9c67e905aa6ee89b0540362bea93717b228ee9",
      "text": "可是……\n两位太过自由散漫是不争的事实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6331811539813100705069d732545ee663ae5c090318063e6811e2cb38ba9a36",
      "text": "好啦好啦九郎酱，\n别把眉心拧得那么紧嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7c53741ad396eb70e7510f8675629b668456683bed778effdc7931fde24fe9f",
      "text": "聊回工作的事吧♪ 如你所见，\n奴家可是很习惯电视和各类活动的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6a8a32a41f42a95f7f2e9910138a3b084bdc287ece9d3778669615922b76a8c",
      "text": "关于这次的工作也能给出建议哦……\n如何？不想听听看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aa37e95c2f34e154348d1ff5b40621af142effea375df7a025fd67d67809092",
      "text": "（虽然经常被华村先生耍得团团转，\n但他对待工作确实非常认真……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fe9aecdc219e77bbe0bb4f93b0bab9c59b15c44e51be51a3852c59a33211742",
      "text": "……请务必，让我听听看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a26ef018da71fed5ccd97631792515d9ecc09d16c2e7d6178d378d20862e348",
      "text": "吾辈也很好奇喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617b10993acbc5bcc357f00d3cac547689ddb7e77eccb9c608edbaa242efc418",
      "text": "既然这样，那大家就一起去搜集点\n能让活动的客人们开心的谈资吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a15df91ac81ed94704f9225f4a203a67cbc9b35849bd77a2fadf8ba050958cec",
      "text": "奴家知道一个好去处哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000141:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000148:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:254ee2908a85135072432cfcd33b7438363f1e8ebce20a7926e9ad35ab01baa4",
      "text": "晚上好，●●●●プロデューサー。\n请问现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000150:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e9e7e6b70343d7fb3336b9d62065d0e7a6a2c07f506dac1c12da7cfa6efadb5",
      "text": "我联系您，是想重新为\n白天的事情向您致歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000152:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64b12a78f90c86907f632deb1c35df9c9fa57aed823eb957f572a85e6503e064",
      "text": "那个时候那样逼问您，\n实在是非常抱歉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000154:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e63642cd655ab7ffcc14ad7cce41b599dac3d8b3519c747c3f6e3365b9408c1",
      "text": "请别放在心上",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000155:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d343ca896cf656862d861688fd5198331ffd14c267246db044a087c376951e73",
      "text": "没关系的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000158:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8391deb40bb53680a4471249717fb32221e8ec8b617d24e3d971401fd9dab51",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……\n谢谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000160:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c703d91b1716d70e2cac74ee0f9294a0e8ca929fff7455356942a3efc94659",
      "text": "但是，对于华村先生的提议，\n我总觉得有一种不祥的预感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000162:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef13c01bdab000492430a0e586ffa83866563913251391ef906fa3028bf7a111",
      "text": "虽然我很尊敬他对待技艺的态度，\n但在那之外就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000164:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c287b472f48639b127ecb7d319ba23fb8b29dafa543fd4006ce9be90bf4e3554",
      "text": "抱歉，这样就又跟白天一样了呢。\n总而言之，希望不要出什么乱子就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87ce42ffb36131a647defea820e627f97ccd1c43e6bb0d3e0eda629a2e45ab8d",
      "text": "……不，为了无论发生什么都能妥善应对，\n今天就早点休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_c:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89d289bf15a5bbfd58a08f93d4699941d21df05e7f46789332b9041b5bf19b70",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也是，\n请好好休息哦。那么，先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:715c9a822496956b4160d74d5929ea19eb824b31af38c187b38b0cb74d27acaa",
      "text": "这个地方是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e67be4287ca7dd4570224eb09b4456ebbac4aefe0a6905160cd4879f12981f1b",
      "text": "这就是传闻中的女仆咖啡厅喵！？\n吾辈还是第一次来喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25430cff506e9c640ef7d2fce680bac9b6371933cd349f7a5536207f4f1f8a4f",
      "text": "这是奴家经常光顾的店哦。\n来，赶紧点单吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8fb58256d1574acc931ca210d64468bea8e4412cc41d41166df090d434bb6a9",
      "text": "“Pureful蛋包饭”、“萌动心弦特饮”……\n菜单的花样真丰富呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06527bda2c99152e40e25da408db062f24d5e69ca8fec89d0fcd70ef8363ce86",
      "text": "既然如此……我点这份\n“Pureful蛋包饭”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e15c2560d8572c73f0456f75a69e20b9567ecdc2058ea98d98f377c3a966e97f",
      "text": "来4份“Pureful蛋包饭”，\n再来4杯“萌动心弦特饮”喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000127:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:961c5f611c369be857b51493e4a7dbe79e5f65472b40062991937f08840e6ea6",
      "text": "让您久等啦～！\n这是您的“Pureful蛋包饭”♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43d01c9e4319dd86022abe40ab0faeb3c9902bc4ebf09c6194fdc59899c8f732",
      "text": "为了主人，\n施下变好吃的魔法吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3c2443826b517718c51b18879b74d797f4adfed3c96cc816c1ca0ccbd302303",
      "text": "双手比个爱心……\n变好吃吧变好吃吧变好吃吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c9b3a6a64510777d76292c8ea8149300ab458ae77613a8145201c94c4596cf7",
      "text": "！？刚才那是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58fbbd382b8281ce8985898a83226930463cf8b372f767a1a97ee46f33221647",
      "text": "是能让蛋包饭变好吃的魔法哦！\n快请用吧，开动咯♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_d:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf3baad1920f2e6a45fac7416e625f086702f7c98b7d0eb0fdd844d427cf8297",
      "text": "谢谢。我开动了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3987e0e38de43943dd1b4f44b90f4b245156e5971b118e971eb7fc24597df3fd",
      "text": "非常抱歉……\n在下吃下去之后，似乎没能体会出魔法的效果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bffdc67071b03cf3e0caf82bac26eb1dca1b0c7563c49f956f0ced50b30cd60",
      "text": "九郎酱真是太认真啦！\n虽说这也是你的优点就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d078ce35967732ed68190f6aca97f52251a6a7d712a1401b1f31c1bcc60047b7",
      "text": "你看。带着款待之心泡的茶，味道\n不也会随之改变吗。就是那个意思啦，那个♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f6ca72bb5c6fd4e919b28a29568b5a685f3e8734150fb4957b04149b988831",
      "text": "原来如此，是这么回事啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184499eb229ae212af9b08cc306f119738987d59019740de59744a1267ae8923",
      "text": "啾哔哔——！……吾辈灵光一闪了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b98caa1b1b75d217a2be0a77adcdca8c87260f08cb293961aff05867315682f",
      "text": "这次轮到九郎君给●●●●プロデューサー君的\n蛋包饭施加魔法了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:365e4e2d3b7ff9e5a56d4d40e17d60303224356ba27e54199fd666cfa48990e3",
      "text": "这样一来，九郎君的款待之力也\n绝对会蹭蹭蹭地升格的喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac32d4c9192b5eb8c2b0c5e2ea0678dd318dceb67e6a62b92fac7c7e74b73559",
      "text": "由我来向●●●●プロデューサー施展魔法……\n我、我知道了。这也算是一种修行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:253d98dbba315aa9f741c518df6052489e30e539e2ba662d4c999115113aa14f",
      "text": "那么……\n变、变好吃吧变好吃吧变好吃吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4938c9f8cb11cd98370d0f560df6de0eb69f0aed5bec072165b9889d34dbdc0",
      "text": "（九郎先生，很努力了呢……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a760a75f410990a0c2cdf940f5f1d8ab81961f2c36d5e648a4cb44ffc72a044",
      "text": "停下——！\n九郎君，这样就可以了吗喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2085b5cee26ed84f63ab744b3fd23ddb649ec95cc963a96ca91614397fe2d35c",
      "text": "阁、阁下的意思是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e316b8617bc3a246207116965889621a28ae5836523be52a491355f092ff22e6",
      "text": "如果心里真的有想要为\n●●●●プロデューサー君着想的心意……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62589e2da15a50f33c68eb7702481884917de6af3a00b8403235c365c7cdeb84",
      "text": "就不应该借用别人的词语！\n难道不该用属于自己的语言吗喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb61f24d98fde315ca36a21d6497c490ed23fdbf6f959a9767a33a0d40cd7eea",
      "text": "这、这……确实正如您所说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_e:cmd-000207:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87efce1ed62f07dfe3e75330bbc3fecce21a91b87f1d0ac3b0e83f10e899e6e8",
      "text": "我竟然没有考虑到这一层。\n请务必让我再挑战一次！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80fb6f1a4cda86aea5f14a5a87d7e4a4e6f31a98481585bd5613d9f60c45d4ac",
      "text": "九郎君和吾辈合力创作的、\n特别咒语……这就来咯喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72ca4af0ed57166bdcc19ba3f3a534171c1fab3c3ed80e3f69d954f188801817",
      "text": "是、是的！那么……\n注、注入心意☆ 喵喵，喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ad9ccc9a3414ec0f24347a2fff54f7214d7c8f88a5f718c458a9fbe348dff56",
      "text": "嗯——虽然不算差，但还是能看出有些害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e5b29bae3338f01adde6bf6100f3214ad6b2187a43f942fc83cb90bc233a4ba",
      "text": "九郎君，下次跟吾辈一起\n喊出来喵！……预备——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53a39fead51dbff17928f9211180de664069083ddf6baf5f13eba7c4c3235585",
      "text": "注入心意☆ 喵喵，喵——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a674cb37d8441ecd4476173feace878c16c69bc50fb00e7b213f5332fe6b564",
      "text": "九郎酱，你该不会只是在凭气势硬撑吧？\n那样的话心意可传达不过去哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b80019a9638f7d67cd4e02b5478b72a1e07d0c8ef0d89a9815523b05e754dcc7",
      "text": "下一次一定要成功喵。\n是九郎君的话一定做得到的喵！预备——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6c4618fc7ed3dc159843ec089a25c80f09529e08df5309b73544783750c0daa",
      "text": "注入心意☆ 喵喵，喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51dffd99d8d76401671462b32d708c88bd4ff5a115d3fc70197fcdf2ae3e98e1",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，觉得如何呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000188:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6020359d89851b6d33f4ed7c037c40c6edfdbb91a0748046da90ae7361ce397d",
      "text": "很好吃",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fda43eaba0e909b0383d25723596c28cf81c30acd90fffb885e89dfe47de4e4",
      "text": "是世界上最美味的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6102a3de06aa158f9a587d26e4e69371d0c2994f0483e0490bcee847474c4cc2",
      "text": "真、真的吗？非常感谢。\n多亏了大家，我才能圆满完成！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1eb6959fe471d58bb8aef4bf387934f9542a18cb44246f0957211a99847f68",
      "text": "有、有那么好吃吗……？\n虽然感觉有些夸张，但我很高兴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000224:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1accd355ac1de1289456d107021778c22586843f9676de9d75a2f9e99954f06a",
      "text": "恭喜你喵，九郎君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_f:cmd-000236:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40a82c5098153f5aa4f23bccc57e9211c75f75a886ef7b6be858ed8d8dd1bfcc",
      "text": "九郎酱，辛苦啦。\n刚才的你，表情可是棒极了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd69907c5ae23276e0e78f03c8143789505a8a3fb6a39eeb841ecf808e8cb2a4",
      "text": "回家路上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa22a5aff10f1b954c4a188c1d8ff3d70dcca578d9d081ecdd7fa7601150ff3",
      "text": "女仆咖啡厅，真是太好玩了喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3554bb43499b44c35a2cd1e8e51ed549ca26dc0607dfc09c983a27ef001b9b8",
      "text": "要是●●●●プロデューサー君\n也能待到最后就好了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ac7c3ffcf71e63958e9a408d5cfe32913fb52b025c4068f44c2137954e8ece",
      "text": "毕竟有工作要开会嘛。\n这也是没办法的事啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7be7722bc359ae42f7cb041656f62ebf6ccb1d7bedc76866254c077db621bf2e",
      "text": "……话说回来华村先生，\n您为什么会经常光顾女仆咖啡厅呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b70e2468c50d0820e1ecf6a20989acc90d8a72d7d4a8609385198955a861a51",
      "text": "啊啊。女仆她们，不正是\n“女孩子”的具象化体现吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50f2281b150527cc0502bef66afc4d78bc9a4eb14fd8644dc29db9947c9a6e71",
      "text": "奴家很喜欢观察她们的神情和举止呢。\n所以才常去的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0c2b4128fb87a4c6ee34380f2d67e44de90e545d6f6d13590fbf7f41fccdd8f",
      "text": "蝶蝶小姐的话，\n感觉穿女仆装也会很合适喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46308363e4cb2338496be3e3ac509da9ed0f60ebae0418a315255a9713c3f260",
      "text": "确实如此。我想一定会是引人注目的、\n光彩照人的女仆吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2d276e64d3c67c3653b54253d65fc124c9094f5dff0cb4167847b050ddfc3f",
      "text": "哎呀，真是的。\n谢谢你们两个啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e62e13d16fae331e5c4f491c8bddfcbcdfbdfb67a425ff61f58fd284e8f029b1",
      "text": "不过……奴家自己可不这么想呢？\n要是这么说的话，你们会吓一跳吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faf72e25f31f468dce5eb3b9047e1a69fb28b63fc9b90f65b2faa3f400cc330a",
      "text": "奴家在美容上毫不懈怠的理由……呵呵，开玩笑啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e5d7b4e76b86e29f3a8ea9b5102459fd2ad69bcffa1ceb9b2ed18ed5fa1fa2f",
      "text": "不知道为什么，突然就很想说出来呢。\n别往心里去哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "text": "……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000201:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60007976065d8c191c013311d494a96342c1032117e08462db02408e87613e68",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，\n不好了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000203:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca140de6f5b19ea625e97ac76174c1cb3a7013848f81aaba46b7c330d2addbbc",
      "text": "吾辈可能对蝶蝶小姐\n说了什么奇怪的话\n了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d830f9ad605c9dddb1029a42f50d106dcd03dc6fad9d74a9da95b438cf500aa8",
      "text": "可是，完全不知道该\n怎么办才好喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000207:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bedc39a7b44843c85501b866d2010a614306a1e237171d433fd6243049de042a",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000207:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:030bd41c050ac15409f1b4cab0550dc4d99a1ccbd37889753adb99ff2ea1f29b",
      "text": "怎么了吗？\n请跟我说说吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000208:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e29d05c756810230f5c212f15fde176cb586737cfe9f27cbf3cf7c71275d8567",
      "text": "请详细跟我讲讲",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000208:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e62afb12288bd111f9c624875efc7f4f04725edfa13389cb02e7fa5098d4595",
      "text": "发生了什么事，\n能详细告诉我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000212:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2646de26b2fbb03f6260580f1e21483f9b4f0366a100834375648743edd97f3",
      "text": "猫柳先生。\n明明说的是\n要去洗手间，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000214:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c3293de9cbaec621d6be56f09c0b4b6d22e5ede5db5289303fd4b300b9a2adc",
      "text": "却在给●●●●プロデューサー\n发信息\n呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000216:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56764248fa9005dd412f026af8b850496d5cf56f6505c381dfb8a1330fd19c65",
      "text": "不过我也在考虑\n同样的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000218:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06be09f210623ada5bfeb1d3ecb3120d0e37fd35060ae9dc8a915ff01a7499fb",
      "text": "我觉得在走到车站之前，\n应该主动向华村先生搭话比较好，\n但是，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000220:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1499e125c52fc029babb3ae888d94c81f2d758b7a473efac4dada147ee1f2bf",
      "text": "<emoji>image_talk_emoji_39</emoji>\n九郎君，停下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000222:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a5bede019b1c9d1b074a066ae0bd230d08248c9513bda049af1190fc8afb86a",
      "text": "说起来这里是\n蝶蝶小姐也在的\n群组喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000224:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9c6372a2b17efc5e33be260463f8cbcf4e69faa854e7ecefc13c4c794d5b91e",
      "text": "实在抱歉，我居然犯了这种糊涂。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_g:cmd-000226:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed81a798ffbd98d7bac2d0ea74f2835e319bbf8887d5d5169450fe6095586d4",
      "text": "制作人君，\n晚点再联系你喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69427f6bf2235e5bf6ba1bc11be3b586eae47c19d3b7194f03a52a78daa01af5",
      "text": "今天非常感谢两位。\n那么，我就先告辞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e1d511f00743f9a115318d699ffef997de9dba0b70ebb3c30c0260f4120d4a",
      "text": "哎呀？怎么了，九郎酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:902d69cbd45847c4e24891a9e604771d895314d8f2978c6e759ff8328e689f55",
      "text": "那个……非常抱歉。\n其实，我一直在意华村先生说的那句话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617930659e74ce7565b0c3025350e25d556ef5cb53898d069efffe431988ba4f",
      "text": "我是否应该对您说些什么才对呢，\n从刚才开始就一直在为此苦恼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e2e42717d5e97ed5deb7f0982c8762e4f5a69897f80fcafbdef2d0087ab8f5c",
      "text": "但是，却找不到\n适合这种场合的言辞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0217d7e533aee21957cdfa6be01b87cc6c0c6cfcdcf003433d1cc353eae7fdaa",
      "text": "九郎酱……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd23933aeb243b535fa6d4c0fd45fca1b6a468590105fa5a0aa5ca68f985d6f",
      "text": "吾辈也是喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26ad33e0ece909dace13a838b1cc0d3f709034fcc04a5fd21e253abfb04b90fa",
      "text": "吾辈是不是说了什么奇怪的话喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b89ffbed4373554e974627f27ce01f8199cf20e071c6278dec4e0531bc18c9d",
      "text": "今天明明那么开心的，要是蝶蝶小姐\n不开心的话吾辈不要喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35f1e3de797cbeecd813930e2b81ab9520f8e1d526fa30d68a641c43de0adff2",
      "text": "连桐生酱也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e65df7237fec3693716b737a526d46bac5eec0a006204d3f660512cc1a0a58",
      "text": "就这样和蝶蝶小姐告别，\n吾辈不要喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc00f39b58df18f8fabdc38e83fdd8b64c423a92ae7660a3189b9d23bb5f12b",
      "text": "我也是一样的心情。\n能请您再多给我们一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:157113be0601b704ff3abe3c963d19d4307865d3475397b5df2d61d78e5d48e6",
      "text": "你们俩……\n讨厌，居然替奴家操心到了这种地步吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e",
      "text": "诶……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13e7774ee08e41248cbd3f88cdf223dd99f029027d390da509a290ae3a41386a",
      "text": "对不起呢，让你们费心了。\n但是，奴家……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb44791e5efe65d57d6c193e6ada9faec641e3a99816637cfeede37c060b90ec",
      "text": "现在心里正觉得暖烘烘的呢。\n明明刚才还在向你们道歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4031193d27e630b5b2c18e5a08261089f9761a3370bbef87da6a6ec2660abef",
      "text": "和你们待在一起的时光太开心了，\n不知不觉就说漏了嘴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85a8cebfdde0472c1e8c84b74dc2622a5945c3f05bc3a753a61a1e7cb3afdf1c",
      "text": "……被人知道自己的软弱之处，\n感觉也并没有那么糟呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1558290e939e1d017e886215160f0c8c1c1ce977a926849610cc3ea4c995de17",
      "text": "呵呵，奴家也舍不得跟你们分开了呢。\n干脆就这样一起去吃甜点吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac1d4053bb17746e19bb967af26f79557e1663fa4dc416495d403cef4c2e02f8",
      "text": "喵喵，平时的蝶蝶小姐\n又回来啦喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_i:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9885fa9f63480aac42ba6a9dfa8fdca1cffdf650475633ef10e8b1ca0002454f",
      "text": "嗯，我们三人一起去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bbb07cdd98550016f2527398106833de68db85e09208d6bb91983f346f5d2e8",
      "text": "活动当天",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efee618a16ca86fc3b516982225ec8d9f8f5a181c8e79cd500045bf7f43a4e0a",
      "text": "情人节限定巧克力“结-yui-”，\n是与著名糕点屋的联名巧克力♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2f0f9fddbfab3b23e1acfe35de21c78727ba84a80ebabc0c7ead7f8629aa5a",
      "text": "只要尝上一口，呀真奇妙！\n整个人都会飘飘然变得幸福起来喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c92dcca89d87dc8dc02b80e75f16cb043a043b34ad64884b173abe75072c361",
      "text": "充满了和风风味，每尝一口，\n都会化作“难以忘怀的滋味”吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145881ac897a41ad4209dacee1a8064ad2832a797ca1d190268c15a66cf0a497",
      "text": "因为是期间限定发售，\n感兴趣的客人请务必尽早购买。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a208e36818c1405d69e81d25e4c85d1b9d21d903c25e523f71a7a29dae632f5f",
      "text": "虽然“结-yui-”是期间限定，\n但在便利店也能轻松买到哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb65c179226b03f22398800c5c790aee5c1a732f9409defdde1933457c7c83a",
      "text": "不仅是恋人，给家人和朋友们，\n也请用这款巧克力传达爱与感谢吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d8e05c9226b05aee361433cc63893b54cae2b0b85ed7ce081ad9d5f5d27b86",
      "text": "说起感谢……九郎君、蝶蝶小姐。\n差不多该进入那个谈话主题了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c7b2bc8b60d85d63c332b9bc6c1edd13dfebebdce6a294e17f6b63488266bb",
      "text": "是的。其实前些天，我和猫柳先生还有华村先生\n一起去了女仆咖啡厅……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b2776ab1487492cdbc90bc67c59168551a930cc4dcbe6e367dcb25dec21138a",
      "text": "诶，彩的三个人居然去女仆咖啡厅！\n感觉挺意外的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_j:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9de0664521fdaeebccca9f7d7ccc316c53a7e31448b4ca72fb8642c7126b25b",
      "text": "（太好了，完全抓住客人们的注意力了！\n大家，保持这股势头加油吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b470e2c6e71e117ef845abae7b15e8b804cd27411d94a85063d120be7ae531c",
      "text": "活动结束数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:303befb9a232b458c20ae821a2677ed9e77bc38928bdaa1d3ffbdb2101f81205",
      "text": "猫柳宅邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41f33ad2c73a20ea8e40382231ea9324b044584b2b95649368a40b044cf4c68f",
      "text": "哎呀呀……因此故而。\n唔唔唔，果然这里还是……唔——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:392164ce68ef9ebf53f12537ece3007615340f42cc763f2e2bfa1ebdd5b96b5e",
      "text": "不行喵～！\n完全没有头绪喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38afd5e2324a7bb902bfab6248f16f255155b6edc6eb2e6fa49b9427c5620702",
      "text": "平时的话应该能啾哔哔——！地灵光一现才对，\n真是奇了怪了喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933e8953d2a317467a3a17556919c272120c4ad27ba9b0252a2834281abe1448",
      "text": "喂，在走廊都能听到你的声音了。\n到底怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fdae4ca0909c6f6e337d355a86afbd51b562c962015972c5b409e8712b4e26e",
      "text": "吾辈本想把前几天的实际工作当作素材，\n构思一段新落语段子喵，可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d220dc0e1db234f2a573484985836e185fab336b38e56c6ef9b0bd1c0823c11",
      "text": "不论怎么摆弄，都写不出比实际发生的事\n更有趣的段子喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abc736768c04379daf71fb729b548695b0a86626a91678efc468c2caf988fbda",
      "text": "吾辈的雷达，\n到底变成什么样了喵～！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9d779278370b7248706e239513e4a666e37a1b45027eb31919a498ad804b06f",
      "text": "呜呜……太惨了喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63517650fc9d6460dcbc18c999de052c99dfafdfebf57b39b9f7bd2d9402e968",
      "text": "那种二流三流的段子，可别讲给别人听啊。\n不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ab1b4b65d368deac1437b0f47769b5cfed81be42709c776aaf3f4a632c2711f",
      "text": "要是这样的话啊，桐生。\n那个段子，只在你们伙伴之间讲不就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42bb4add34844a6516e3af3785d3df9ab491b5eab65fe58ce959ee8cff664a50",
      "text": "只在伙伴之间限定的段子……\n不愧是师父，听起来好特别喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10005_01:1_3_10005_01_k:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac15d39b1dc59f263513bee0d68cefabc8bbe567829df8a3488489ffc72aecd8",
      "text": "这是只属于我们大家的、\n特别故事喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
